WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:07.300
I have decided to keep a journal to set down all my thoughts and the simple events of my day

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.920
I will keep this diary for one year and at the end of that time it will be destroyed

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.740
I encouraged my son to enlist. 
It was a family tradition

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.500
Six months later, he was dead in Iraq.
I was lost.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.500
Thus ends the reading of the Lord, praise be God

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.200
So how are you?
I'm fine

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.100
No, really

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.640
It's been a while since we've talked.
Even a pastor needs a pastor

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:40.040
Did you see the doctor?

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.160
You need someone to take care of you.
I want you to be happy.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.620
I know that nothing can change

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:47.740
And I know there is no hope

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.100
Reverend Toller?
Yes, Mary

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:54.460
You must come over.
You must come over now

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:01.720
Explosives.
He was becoming someone I didn't know

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:05.660
Opportunistic diseases, anarchy, martial law.
You will live to see this

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.660
And you had no idea that he was thinking...
No

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:09.340
I'm so frightened

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:14.240
These kids, they want certainty

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.340
You know, don't think, follow

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:19.300
They fall prey to extremism.
It's a world without hope

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.040
No, I have not lost my faith

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:27.460
You think that what we did together was a sin

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.680
I've seen enough real sin to know the difference

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:31.220
You didn't tell the police, right?

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:34.060
Take a look at your own life before you criticize others

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:37.460
These are frightening times.
We have to be patient

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:39.580
Well somebody has to do something

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:57.700
My hands shake as I write these lines

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:07.960
Can God forgive us for what we've done to this world?

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.800
Who can know the mind of God?

